# gantry's own run artifacts. The chain writes these at the worktree root and
# they are deliberately NOT committed — see docs/ARCHITECTURE.md § "The artifact
# contract". Anchored so a project's own nested task.md is untouched.
# In a target repo the drivers assert the same patterns in .git/info/exclude via
# lib/ensure_excluded.sh, which needs no edit to a tracked file.
/task.md
/plan.md
/handover.md
